      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/a5b964/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-11T04:14:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>But are they having fun? That's the main thing. As long as everyone is enjoying themselves. And if they aren't, maybe you should go for a few palate-cleanser games with easier villains, just to let everyone feel better about themselves. Ego-boost, as it were. Personally, I like bemoaning a loss, particularly if it was a close one. When you just get absolutely wrecked, I die a little inside.</p>",
